# Vendored subchart archives, generated by `helm dependency update`.
# Non-deterministic (gzip embeds timestamps), so re-running it locally with
# zero real content change still produces a byte-different .tgz -- a stray,
# confusing diff. CI already runs `helm dependency update` fresh right
# before packaging/lint on every run (see publish-charts.yaml's "Helm lint"
# step), so nothing here is actually needed for the pipeline to work.
# Chart.lock (the real version pin) stays committed.
**/charts/*.tgz
